# Kokoro TTS Configuration
#
# Image: ghcr.io/remsky/kokoro-fastapi-cpu:latest (CPU-only, ~500MB RAM idle)
# Port: 127.0.0.1:8880 (loopback only — edit docker-compose.yml for LAN access)
#
# No env vars required — the model auto-downloads on first start.
# Model files are persisted in a Docker volume (kokoro_models).
#
# Available voices (82M ONNX model):
#   American English:  af_bella (cutest), af_heart (warm), af_nicole, af_aoede, af_kore, af_sarah
#   American English:  am_adam, am_michael
#   British English:   bf_emma, bf_isabella, bm_george, bm_lewis
#
# API:
#   POST /v1/audio/speech
#   Body: {"input": "Hello world", "voice": "af_bella"}
#   Returns: audio/wav
#
#   GET /health  → 200 OK
